🟨 Part B – Introduction to EDA

🔍 19. What is EDA?

Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) is the process of understanding, cleaning, summarizing, and visualizing data before building Machine Learning models.

🎯 Objectives

Understand the Dataset

Find Missing Values

Detect Outliers

Discover Patterns

Visualize Relationships



---

